', 'Height above the beach against time for a ball thrown up at 15 m s⁻¹ from a 20 m cliff: it rises, turns and falls past the cliff top to the beach.'),
('db2e1caa-26d0-556c-b1c1-b93c79272901', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '69f49b38-4492-521c-be78-56effb528ad2', 'a-level', '2.8', '9702 coursebook 2.8 · The equations of motion', 46, 46, 'Two cars start from rest together. Car A accelerates at 2.0 m s⁻² and car B at 3.0 m s⁻². (a) Calculate how far ahead B is after 10 s. (b) Calculate B''s speed at that time.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '50', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) s_B − s_A = 0.5 × 3.0 × 10² − 0.5 × 2.0 × 10² = 50 m. (b) v_B = 3.0 × 10 = 30 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (5 marks). M1: s = ½at² each. C1: difference. C1: value. C1: v_B. A1: Δs = 50 m.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('400e2908-e2d2-5f95-bee4-e280bf306368', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '69f49b38-4492-521c-be78-56effb528ad2', 'a-level', '2.8', '9702 coursebook 2.8 · The equations of motion', 47, 47, 'A car travelling at 18 m s⁻¹ passes a stationary police car, which immediately accelerates at 3.0 m s⁻². (a) Write the displacement of each car after time t. (b) Calculate when the police car catches up. (c) Calculate the police car''s speed then.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '36', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) s₁ = 18t; s₂ = 1.5t². (b) 1.5t² = 18t gives t = 12 s. (c) v = 3.0 × 12 = 36 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (6 marks). B1: s₁. B1: s₂. M1: equate. C1: t = 12 s. C1: speed. A1: v = 36 m s⁻¹.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg5306ec34-t fg5306ec34-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg5306ec34-t">Police chase</title><desc id="fg5306ec34-d">Displacement–time graphs: the car at a steady 18 m s⁻¹ (straight line) and the police car accelerating at 3.0 m s⁻² from rest (curve); they cross at 12 s.</desc><line x1="36.2" y1="34" x2="36.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="85.6" y1="34" x2="85.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="135" y1="34" x2="135" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="184.4" y1="34" x2="184.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="233.8" y1="34" x2="233.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="283.2" y1="34" x2="283.2" y2="242" 