('233edaf3-fac1-5785-a021-ed805ec10565', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '69f49b38-4492-521c-be78-56effb528ad2', 'a-level', '2.8', '9702 coursebook 2.8 · The equations of motion', 48, 48, 'A stone is dropped down a well and the splash is heard 2.4 s later. Ignoring the time for the sound to travel up: (a) calculate the depth; (b) explain whether the true depth is larger or smaller. Take g = 9.81 m s⁻².', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '28.25', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) s = 0.5 × 9.81 × 2.4² = 28.3 m. (b) Smaller: part of the 2.4 s is the sound returning, so the fall time is less. Mark scheme (5 marks). M1: s = ½gt². C1: value. B1: smaller. B1: reason. A1: h = 28.3 m.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('74510c7a-19d2-5bd0-b484-bd330e493f2a', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '69f49b38-4492-521c-be78-56effb528ad2', 'a-level', '2.8', '9702 coursebook 2.8 · The equations of motion', 49, 49, 'A train starts from rest, accelerates at 0.60 m s⁻² for 40 s, travels at constant speed for 2.0 minutes and then decelerates at 0.80 m s⁻² to rest. (a) Calculate the top speed. (b) Calculate the distance in each stage. (c) Calculate the total distance.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '3720', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) v = 0.60 × 40 = 24 m s⁻¹. (b) 0.5 × 0.60 × 40² = 480 m; 24 × 120 = 2880 m; 24² ÷ (2 × 0.80) = 360 m. (c) 480 + 2880 + 360 = 3720 m. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: top speed. C1: stage 1. C1: stage 2. C1: stage 3. C1: total. A1: s = 3720 m.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg572db8ab-t fg572db8ab-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg572db8ab-t">Train journey</title><desc id="fg572db8ab-d">A v–t graph rising to 24 m s⁻¹ in 40 s, constant for 120 s, falling to rest in 30 s, with the area shaded.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="100" y1="34" x2="100" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="170.5" y1="34" x2="170.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="241" y1="34" x2="241" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="311.5" y1="34" x2="311.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" 