('550388ed-42b3-5f1e-8e3e-0a01ce42fde4', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '69f49b38-4492-521c-be78-56effb528ad2', 'a-level', '2.8', '9702 coursebook 2.8 · The equations of motion', 50, 50, 'A ball rolls up a slope at 6.0 m s⁻¹ with deceleration 1.5 m s⁻². (a) Calculate how far up the slope it travels. (b) Calculate its velocity 6.0 s after starting, taking up the slope as positive.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '-3', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, true, NULL, '(a) s = 6.0² ÷ (2 × 1.5) = 12 m. (b) v = 6.0 − 1.5 × 6.0 = −3.0 m s⁻¹ (rolling back down). Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: distance. M1: v = u + at with sign. C1: value. B1: interpretation. A1: v = −3.0 m s⁻¹.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('a5a3cb71-9416-5735-9f66-93d387efdd12', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '69f49b38-4492-521c-be78-56effb528ad2', 'a-level', '2.8', '9702 coursebook 2.8 · The equations of motion', 51, 51, 'A car driver sees a hazard 50 m ahead while moving at 20 m s⁻¹. Her reaction time is 0.70 s and the car decelerates at 5.0 m s⁻². (a) Calculate the thinking distance. (b) Calculate the braking distance. (c) Calculate by how much the car stops short of the hazard.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '-4', 'm', false, NULL, true, NULL, '(a) 20 × 0.70 = 14 m. (b) 20² ÷ (2 × 5.0) = 40 m. (c) Total 54 m, which is more than 50 m: the car does not stop in time; it would need 50 − 54 = −4.0 m, i.e. it travels 4.0 m too far. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: thinking. C1: braking. C1: total. M1: compare. C1: value. A1: Δs = −4.0 m.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgc4ad2258-t fgc4ad2258-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgc4ad2258-t">Thinking and braking</title><desc id="fgc4ad2258-d">A v–t graph constant at 20 m s⁻¹ for the 0.70 s reaction time and then falling to zero at 5.0 m s⁻², with the area shaded.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="100" y1="34" x2="100" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="170.5" y1="34" x2="170.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="241" y1="34" x2="241" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="311.5" y1="34" x2="311.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none