.7" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="63.7" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">30</text><text x="205.7" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">t / s</text><text x="25.4" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">v / m s⁻¹</text><polyline points="29.4,242 205.7,67.1 325.3,212.3 382,212.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'A v–t graph rising at 9.81 m s⁻² for 3.0 s, falling at 12 m s⁻² to 5.0 m s⁻¹, then constant (down positive).'),
('5e6eb13c-ea8e-5ceb-aa56-141283cfebe5', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '69f49b38-4492-521c-be78-56effb528ad2', 'a-level', '2.8', '9702 coursebook 2.8 · The equations of motion', 53, 53, 'A ball is thrown upwards at 12 m s⁻¹. (a) Write an expression for its height after time t. (b) Calculate the later time at which it is 5.0 m above the start. Take g = 9.81 m s⁻².', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.914', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) h = 12t − 4.905t². (b) Setting h to 5.0 m and using the quadratic formula: t = (12 + √(12² − 4 × 4.905 × 5.0)) ÷ 9.81 = 1.91 s. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: expression. M1: quadratic. C1: substitution. C1: later root. A1: t = 1.91 s.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('07929d60-7c7b-517c-8675-4e9ab11def2b', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '69f49b38-4492-521c-be78-56effb528ad2', 'a-level', '2.8', '9702 coursebook 2.8 · The equations of motion', 54, 54, 'Car A starts from rest with acceleration 2.0 m s⁻² just as car B, 50 m behind it, passes at a steady 15 m s⁻¹. (a) Write the displacement of each from B''s starting point. (b) Find when B first draws level with A.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '5', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) s_A = 50 + t²; s_B = 15t. (b) t² − 15t + 50 (set to zero) has roots 5 and 10, so B first draws level at t = (15 − √(15² − 4 × 50)) ÷ 2 = 5.0 s. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: equations. M1: equate. C1: quadratic. C1: smaller root. A1: t = 5.0 s.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fga0c541e8-t fga0c541e8-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fga0c541e8-t">Catching up</title><desc id="fga0c541e8-d">Displacement–time graphs from B''s start: car A starting at 50 m with acceleration 2.0 m s⁻² (curve) and car B at a steady 15 m s⁻¹ (line).</desc><line x1="36.2" y1="34" x2="36.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="93.8" y1="34" x2="93.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="151.4" y1="34" x2="151.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="209.1" y1="34" x2="209.1" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="266.7" y1="34" x2="266.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="324.4" y1="34" x2="32