rentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="382" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><line x1="25.4" y1="242" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="242" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="25.4" y1="172.7" x2="29.4" y2="172.7" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="172.7" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><line x1="25.4" y1="103.3" x2="29.4" y2="103.3" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="103.3" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">8</text><line x1="25.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="34" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">12</text><text x="205.7" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">t / s</text><text x="25.4" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">v / m s⁻¹</text><polygon points="29.4,242 117.6,138 205.7,94.7 293.9,75.6 382,68.7 382,242 29.4,242" style="stroke:none;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polyline points="29.4,242 117.6,138 205.7,94.7 293.9,75.6 382,68.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'Speed readings 0, 6.0, 8.5, 9.6 and 10.0 m s⁻¹ at 0–4 s joined by straight lines, with the area (trapezia) shaded.'),
('5942250d-2dda-53f4-aae3-8210fa23efb8', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 38, 38, 'For the sprinter (0, 6.0, 8.5, 9.6, 10.0 m s⁻¹ at 0–4 s), calculate the average acceleration in the first second and in the fourth second. Give the first minus the fourth.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '5.6', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'First: 6.0 ÷ 1 = 6.0 m s⁻²; fourth: (10.0 − 9.6) ÷ 1 = 0.40 m s⁻²; difference = 6.0 − 0.40 = 5.6 m s⁻². Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: both. C1: difference. A1: Δa = 5.6 m s⁻².', 3, NULL, NULL),
('3e17474e-d3e8-5a9b-b3e6-7015b04a2e54', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 39, 39, 'An object''s velocity is v = 2.0t + 0.50t² (v in m s⁻¹, t in s). Calculate its average acceleration from t = 0 to t = 4.0 s.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '4', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v(4.0) = 2.0 × 4.0 + 0.50 × 4.0² = 16 m s⁻¹; a = 16 ÷ 4.0 = 4.0 m s⁻². Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v(4.0). C1: Δv/Δt. A1: a = 4.0 m s⁻².', 3, NULL, NULL),
