('b7cd0509-e10e-591a-9007-d77e6aa73048', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 45, 45, 'A car''s velocity is v = 20(1 − e^(−t/5.0)) m s⁻¹. (a) Calculate v at 5.0 s. (b) The acceleration is a = 4.0e^(−t/5.0). Calculate it at 5.0 s. (c) State the limit of a as t becomes large.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.472', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) v = 20 × (1 − e^(−1)) = 12.6 m s⁻¹. (b) a = 4.0 × e^(−1) = 1.47 m s⁻². (c) Zero. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: v. M1: substitution in a. C1: value. B1: limit zero. A1: a = 1.47 m s⁻².', 5, NULL, NULL),
('35ee39c0-059b-542c-940c-c62497006e8b', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 46, 46, 'An a–t graph for a lift (up positive): +1.2 m s⁻² for 2.0 s, 0 for 5.0 s, −0.80 m s⁻² for 3.0 s, from rest. (a) Calculate the speed after 2.0 s. (b) Calculate the speed at 10 s. (c) Calculate the total height risen.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '18', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) v = 1.2 × 2.0 = 2.4 m s⁻¹. (b) v = 2.4 − 0.80 × 3.0 = 0. (c) 0.5 × 1.2 × 2.0² + 2.4 × 5.0 + (2.4 × 3.0 − 0.5 × 0.80 × 3.0²) = 2.4 + 12 + 3.6 = 18 m. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: speed. C1: final speed. M1: suvat per stage. C1: stage distances. C1: total. A1: h = 18 m.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg18a482a8-t fg18a482a8-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg18a482a8-t">Lift acceleration</title><desc id="fg18a482a8-d">An a–t graph: +1.2 m s⁻² for 2.0 s, zero for 5.0 s, then −0.80 m s⁻² for 3.0 s.</desc><line x1="39.8" y1="34" x2="39.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="108.2" y1="34" x2="108.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="176.7" y1="34" x2="176.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="245.1" y1="34" x2="245.1" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="313.6" y1="34" x2="313.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242"