nt-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2</text><line x1="293.9" y1="242" x2="293.9" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="293.9" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3</text><line x1="382" y1="242" x2="382" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="382" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><line x1="25.4" y1="242" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="242" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="25.4" y1="190" x2="29.4" y2="190" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="190" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">10</text><line x1="25.4" y1="138" x2="29.4" y2="138" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="138" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">20</text><line x1="25.4" y1="86" x2="29.4" y2="86" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="86" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">30</text><line x1="25.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="34" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">40</text><text x="205.7" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">t / s</text><text x="25.4" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">v / m s⁻¹</text><polyline points="29.4,242 117.6,195.2 205.7,156.2 293.9,127.6 382,109.4" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polyline points="29.4,242 382,38" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:5 4"/></svg>', 'Speeds 0, 9.0, 16.5, 22.0 and 25.5 m s⁻¹ at 0–4 s (joined), with the free-fall line v = 9.81t dashed for comparison.'),
('f9048594-1037-57c8-b2b5-291d4f7d0bb2', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 49, 49, 'A car accelerates from rest with a = 3.0 − 0.50t (m s⁻², 0 ≤ t ≤ 6.0 s). (a) Sketch the a–t graph and state its value at 6.0 s. (b) Calculate the speed at 6.0 s from the area under the a–t graph.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '9', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) A straight line from 3.0 m s⁻² falling to 0 at 6.0 s. (b) Δv = 0.5 × 3.0 × 6.0 = 9.0 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: straight line to zero. M1: area = Δv. C1: triangle. C1: value. A1: v = 9.0 m s⁻¹.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgd3d780a6-t fgd3d780a6-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgd3d780a6-t">a = 3.0 − 0.50t</title><desc id="fgd3d780a6-d">An a–t graph falling in a straight line from 3.0 m s⁻² to zero at 6.0 s, with the area shaded.</desc><line x1="24" y1="34" x2="24" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="75.1" y1="34" x2="75.1" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="126.3" y1="34" x2="126.3" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="177.4" y1="34" x2="177.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="228.6" y1="34" x2="228.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="279.7" y1="34" x2="279.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="330.9" y1="34" x2="330.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="24" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="24" y1="190" x2="382" y2="190" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="24" y1="138" x2="382" y2="138" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="24" y1="86" x2="382" y2="86" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="24" y1="34" x2="382" y2="34" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="24" y1="242" x2="388" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="24" y1="242" x2="24" y2="28" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="392,242 385.7,245 385.7,239" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><polygon points="24,24 27,30.3 21,30.3" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="24" y1="242" x2="24" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="24" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="75.1" y1="242" x2="75.1" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="75.1" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">1</text><line x1="126.3" y1="242" x2="126.3" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="126.3" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2</text><line x1="177.4" y1="242" x2="177.4" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="177.4" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3</text><line x1="228.6" y1="242" x2="228.6" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="228.6" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><line x1="279.7" y1="242" x2="279.7" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="279.7" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">5</text><line x1="330.9" y1="242" x2="330.9" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="330.9" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">6</text><line x1="382" y1="242" x2="382" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="382" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">7</text><line x1="20" y1="242" x2="24" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="17" y="242" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="20" y1="190" x2="24" y2="190" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="17" y="190" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">1</text><line x1="20" y1="138" x2="24" y2="138" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="17" y="138" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2</text><line x1="20" y1="86" x2="24" y2="86" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="17" y="86" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3</text><line x1="20" y1="34" x2="24" y2="34" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="17" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><text x="203" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">t / s</text><text x="20" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">a / m s⁻²</text><polygon points="24,86 330.9,242 330.9,242 24,242" style="stroke:none;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polyline points="24,86 330.9,242" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'An a–t graph falling in a straight line from 3.0 m s⁻² to zero at 6.0 s, with the area shaded.'),
('9b31516d-d4ae-5532-8df0-7773170e0405', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 50, 50, 'A train accelerates from rest at 0.80 m s⁻² for 15 s and then at 0.40 m s⁻² for a further 25 s. (a) Calculate the speed after 15 s. (b) Calculate the speed after 40 s. (c) Calculate the average acceleration over 40 s.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.55', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 0.80 × 15 = 12 m s⁻¹. (b) 12 + 0.40 × 25 = 22 m s⁻¹. (c) a = 22 ÷ 40 = 0.55 m s⁻². Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: first speed. C1: second speed. M1: Δv/t. C1: value. A1: a = 0.55 m s⁻².', 5, NULL, NULL),
('cc98813e-da9d-51bc-ae70-e301a4efe0ec', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 51, 51, 'A cyclist''s speed rises from 4.0 m s⁻¹ with acceleration 1.0 m s⁻² for 4.0 s, then 0.25 m s⁻² for 8.0 s. (a) Calculate the speed at 4.0 s and at 12 s. (b) Calculate the distance in each stage. (c) Calculate the average speed over 12 s.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '8', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 4.0 + 1.0 × 4.0 = 8.0 m s⁻¹; 8.0 + 0.25 × 8.0 = 10 m s⁻¹. (b) 4.0 × 4.0 + 0.5 × 1.0 × 4.0² = 24 m; 8.0 × 8.0 + 0.5 × 0.25 × 8.0² = 72 m. (c) (24 + 72) ÷ 12 = 8.00 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: speeds. C1: stage 1. C1: stage 2. M1: total ÷ time. C1: value. A1: v = 8.0 m s⁻¹.', 6, NULL, NULL),
('e47fea56-1456-560d-9484-bea559530ca4', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 52, 52, 'Explain why a parachutist''s v–t graph has a steep curve after the parachute opens and then levels off. Then calculate the average deceleration if she slows from 55 m s⁻¹ to 6.0 m s⁻¹ in 2.5 s.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '19.6', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Drag suddenly exceeds weight, so she decelerates; as she slows, drag falls until it equals weight again and v is constant. a = (55 − 6.0) ÷ 2.5 = 19.6 m s⁻². Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: drag > weight. B1: drag falls to equal weight. M1: Δv/t. C1: value. A1: a = 19.6 m s⁻².', 5, NULL, NULL),
('d586cf57-9521-598d-9e4e-244ab01d2d9d', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '643b6cd1-3fbe-4618-9330-b9d737f06161', 'a-level', '2.10', '9702 coursebook 2.10 · Uniform and non-uniform acceleration', 53, 53, 'A car''s velocity is v = 15(1 − e^(−t/3.0)) m s⁻¹. (a) Calculate v at 2.5 s and 3.5 s. (b) Estimate the acceleration at 3.0 s from the chord.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.848', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) v(2.5) = 8.481 m s⁻¹; v(3.5) = 10.33 m s⁻¹. (b) a ≈ (10.33 − 8.481) ÷ 1.0 = 1.85 m s⁻². Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: v(2.5). C1: v(3.5). M1: chord gradient. C1: value. A1: a = 1.85 m s⁻².', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg5520187c-t fg5520187c-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg5520187c-t">Approaching 15 m s⁻¹</title><desc id="fg5520187c-d">The curve v = 15(1 − e^(−t/3.0)) levelling off towards 15 m s⁻¹, with the chord from 2.5 s to 3.5 s highlighted.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="88.2" y1="34" x2="88.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="147" y1="34" x2="147" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="205.7" y1="34" x2="205.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="264.5" y1="34" x2="264.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="323.2" y1="34" x2="323.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><li