ext x="17" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><text x="203" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">t / s</text><text x="20" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">a / m s⁻²</text><polygon points="24,86 154.2,86 349.5,242 349.5,242 24,242" style="stroke:none;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polyline points="24,86 154.2,86 349.5,242" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'An a–t graph constant at 3.0 m s⁻² for 4.0 s and then falling in a straight line to zero at 10 s, with the area shaded.')
